t when needed.\\nRead the actual public contracts before deriving a concrete usage example.\\n\\nAuthor the requested Markdown yourself against the TASK's six criteria. Do not\\ncopy a prepared answer: none is supplied. Before the one intended write, take\\nyour own workspace.observe under the fixed Worker-tool policy. Root's Context\\nobservations use a different policy digest and must not be reused as Writer\\ncurrentness. Observe the exact target and relevant source scopes. Carry the\\nactual observation ArtifactRef returned by the tool into work.write.\\n\\nUse work.write with the named grant, whole regular-file target with sha256=null,\\nmode=replace, record.text equal to your authored Markdown, record.provenance\\nequal to the exact TASK SourceRef, interpretation=null and your current\\nobservations. Keep the guide at most140 lines. If the target is present, a\\nbasis changed, publication is unknown or any required premise is missing,\\nreturn that truth; do not pick a new target or silently retry.\\n\\nAfter an observed successful write, use its actual postimage hash to acquire\\nthe guide with source.read utf8 and its operation/transition evidence with\\nevidence.read. Perform the requested F_P evaluation yourself. An available\\ntool response is not independent acceptance, a general completion proof or\\na savings/quality claim. Preserve failures/unknowns and owner disposition.\\n\\nReturn exactly one unfenced a_c.fd-support.closed-return/1 JSON object as the\\nfinal text, with integer-only JSON numbers. Discover the actual carrier keys\\nfrom tools.describe or the HOW. Use the frame id/revision in the packet,\\nboundaries.activation_identity for the exact activation coordinate, the\\npacket's subject/basis, your exact actor identifiers above and consumer /root.\\nDo not substitute the Context, raw packet or Preflight digest for activation.\\nFor guide-task-criteria use the exact TASK SourceRef as predicate; state your\\nactual domain_outcome/core_value, acquired evidence, residuals and invalidators.\\nUse not_performed for any unperformed evaluation. A Worker work_result may say\\ncandidate_ready only for the exact acquired guide SourceRef plus actual\\ntransition evidence and a supported cause. Otherwise return incomplete,\\nrefused or re_entry_requested truthfully. No recommendation is automatically\\naccepted, no review is performed here, and no next action is implicit.\\n\",\"coordinates\":null,\"encoding\":\"utf8\",\"parent_sha256\":\"66bb45f919bc4f9ead81076a4acafbc2d2a46566df73c89f43147967eb5cc4b4\",\"selected_sha256\":\"66bb45f919bc4f9ead81076a4acafbc2d2a46566df73c89f43147967eb5cc4b4\",\"size_bytes\":3364,\"source\":{\"engine\":\"workspace-regular-file\",\"object\":null,\"path\":\"worker-instructions.md\",\"root\":\"runtime\",\"selector\":null,\"sha256\":\"66bb45f919bc4f9ead81076a4acafbc2d2a46566df73c89f43147967eb5cc4b4\"}}},\"schema\":\"a_c.fd-support.response/1\",\"status\":\"ok\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"535f6348-4431-46d7-8be9-cc4226928f8b","uuid":"32aa6165-4fc1-4081-a769-b9359ccce3cc","timestamp":"2026-10-18T21:33:25.778Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"evidence\":{\"id\":\"sha256:03b444eeb6e586727262a7b4dd636467f4b3109b5d901bd40c179a8b54a996f4\",\"sha256\":\"03b444eeb6e586727262a7b4dd636467f4b3109b5d901bd40c179a8b54a996f4\"},\"id\":\"w003-read-instructions\",\"operation\":\"source.read\",\"operation_outcome\":{\"cause\":\"declared output available\",\"core_value\":\"satisfied\",\"evidence\":[],\"limits\":[\"output availability only; no semantic acceptance\"],\"predicate\":\"B(source.read)[request_sha256=5ce8b9ab4ec15615a58d30df68f8af181f65c8df4362071f316c80c064aed1bb]: declared output availability\",\"source_parent\":{\"clause\":\"results\",\"member\":\"FOUNDATIONS.md\",\"sha256\":\"fd2d895f90eb39bda0950c1c7ff02057ef5d8ae73fcbc5b3203f7e99081d6e3f\"},\"value\":\"returned\"},\"refusal\":null,\"result\":{\"artifact\":null,\"value\":{\"acquisition\":{},\"content\":\"# Worker instruction